@CourseSync.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5065

### Send auth code (only @edu.hse.ru)
POST {{CourseSync.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/send-code
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "name.surname@edu.hse.ru"
}

###

### Login (paste requestId from send-code response and the code from the email)
POST {{CourseSync.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "name.surname@edu.hse.ru",
  "requestId": "req_...",
  "code": "123456"
}

###

### Refresh (paste refreshToken from login response)
POST {{CourseSync.Api_HostAddress}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "..."
}
